            "notes": "This round is simple, you buy [Primal Punch](item_3b024d32-8fa1-4713-80ee-e042867f5228) which is the foundation of our build. I like to go with [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) and [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) to add to that melee dmg while also giving you some small healing while you melee. \n\nI'd say important part of this round is getting a feel for the other team, how they play, how bunched up they are, which enemies peel, which enemies have abilities to disrupt what you want to do etc. Find their weaknesses as well as potential enemies that you might have a hard time dealing with.",
