            "notes": "This round is where we can start to lean into our build by going heavy into the armor aspect with [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) and [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09). These allow us to be a lot tankier while dealing a lot more damage ( [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) gives us 100 armor and also 20% melee dmg boost because of [Primal Punch](item_3b024d32-8fa1-4713-80ee-e042867f5228)). \n\nIF THEY HAVE [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) OR A LOT OF BURST GET [Smart-Armor](item_2e0f4a99-c818-49c1-ace2-ba8d6f282da8) instead of [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) TO SURVIVE LONGER",
