            "notes": "Now we buy [Tesla Field](item_68f73d99-6d07-40f5-ad28-0c69f45487c7) to add to the oppressiveness of our dives. This coupled with [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) makes it so right when you dive someone, your bubble or your slam (if bubble's on cooldown but you still wanna dive someone) applies antiheal instantly so it makes it way easier for you to finish them off. \n\nIf you didnt buy [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) last round I would recommend selling [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) or [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) (whichever you need less depending on enemy dmg output) to buy [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) as well as [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) because these are so important for your lethality and worth sacrificing some survivability for.",
