            "notes": "This round is pretty simple:\n\nGet [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) if you can survive well and want to increase your lethality.\n\nOR\n\nGet [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) or [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) (whichever you dont have) if you want more tankiness.\n\nAt this point in the game, both are good options, just depends on what you need, but your build should have good enough tankiness and dmg output so buff whatever you like more.\n\nAn ok third option is [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) if they are hard to pin down or they have a lucio but its a very niche situation and I recommend the other abilities more.",
